***REMOVED*** ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** terraform.tfvars.example — committed example file
***REMOVED*** ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** Copy this file to terraform.tfvars (which is gitignored) and set your actual
***REMOVED*** values there. Sensitive values can also be exported as TF_VAR_* env vars.
***REMOVED*** In normal use, scripts/fetch_vault.sh renders terraform.tfvars from Bitwarden.
***REMOVED*** ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

***REMOVED*** Project base domain (services compose as <subdomain>.<domain_name>, e.g. hermes.zet.rclb.dev)
domain_name = "your-domain.example.com"

***REMOVED*** Cloudflare zone (apex, e.g. example.com) — zone lookup + apex records
zone_name = "example.com"

***REMOVED*** SSH connection metadata for the VPS
ssh_user = "your-ssh-user"
ssh_port = 22

***REMOVED*** Primary public IPv4 address of the VPS (used for DNS A records)
vps_ip = "203.0.113.1"

***REMOVED*** Subdomains to create as A records under domain_name
subdomains = ["app", "www"]

***REMOVED*** VPS configuration in your provider's control panel
vps_display_name = "my-zet"
vps_plan_code    = "<your-plan-code>"
vps_os           = "Debian 12"

***REMOVED*** SSH key and image ID must both be set together (some providers require this)
ssh_public_key = "ssh-ed25519 AAAA..."
vps_image_id   = "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"

***REMOVED*** S3-compatible Object Storage bucket for Tofu state (backups deferred)
state_bucket_name  = "my-zet-tofu-state"

***REMOVED*** S3-compatible Object Storage connection settings
storage_region     = "<your-region>"
storage_endpoint   = "<your-storage-endpoint>"
storage_access_key = "my-access-key"
storage_secret_key = "my-secret-key"

***REMOVED*** Cloudflare API token for DNS (Zone:Read + Zone:DNS:Edit for domain)
***REMOVED*** Source: Bitwarden SM RCLB_DEV_CLOUDFLARE_API_KEY
cloudflare_api_token = "your-cloudflare-api-token"
